      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weekly Skool events → WhatsApp\n\n**When:** every Monday 9:00 (edit the Cron).\n**What:** fresh-login to Skool (admin), read this week's events via the [Skool All-in-One API actor](https://apify.com/cristiantala/skool-all-in-one-api?utm_source=n8n-template&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=n8n-skool-events-whatsapp), and post them to a WhatsApp group via Evolution API.\n\n**Silent skip** if there are no events in range — no spam.\n\nFull guide: https://ctala.github.io/skool-api-docs/recipes/automate-skool-events/\n\nNo Skool community yet? https://www.skool.com/signup?ref=114150f098fc40ba9b365fa78be01a63",
        "height": 360,
